# Proposed by the swarm (2026-10-14, bug bash 1); the documenter may edit or drop it.
# Story: framed on Safari, with Mail docked out of view. Mail plays a video full screen, and its user tells Arbor not to
# arrange Mail any more. The video ends: macOS gives Mail the frame it had, which is the corner Arbor kept it in.
# Arbor still owes it a place in view.
# Reference: F30, F11.
open Safari
open Mail
dock 101 left
dock 102 right
zoom 101
expect hidden 102
fullscreen 102 on
exclude com.example.mail
fullscreen 102 off
wait 1
expect visible 102
expect visible 101
